 <div class="overlay" id="intro"><section class="panel"><div class="eyebrow">DROP IN • RACE OUT</div><h1 class="hero-title">RIFT<span>RALLY</span></h1><p class="desc">The island is your track. Drift the wild turns, grab a power-up, and leave the whole lobby in your dust.</p><div class="feature-row"><div class="feature">🏝 <strong>3</strong> LAPS</div><div class="feature">⚡ DRIFT TO BOOST</div><div class="feature">🎁 PICK UP & PLAY</div></div><button class="start-btn" id="start"><span class="play-icon">▶</span><span class="start-copy">DROP INTO THE RACE<small>4 RACERS · 1 ISLAND · GO!</small></span></button><div class="footnote">WASD / ARROWS to steer &nbsp;·&nbsp; SPACE drift &nbsp;·&nbsp; E use item</div></section></div>
 <div class="result" id="result"><div class="result-card"><div class="result-kicker">ISLAND CIRCUIT • FINISH</div><div class="result-title" id="resultTitle">VICTORY!</div><p class="result-sub" id="resultSub">You owned the island.</p><div class="result-stats"><div class="stat"><strong id="resultPlace">1ST</strong><small>FINISH</small></div><div class="stat"><strong id="resultTime">00:00</strong><small>TIME</small></div><div class="stat"><strong id="resultBoost">0</strong><small>BOOSTS</small></div></div><button class="again" id="again">RACE AGAIN ↗</button></div></div>
